<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Cascade rated attractive.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Cascade rated attractive.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Deutsche Morgan Grenfell analyst Jim Parmelee said he started Cascade Communications Corp with an accumulate rating and set a $50 12-month share price target.</p>
<p>-- He estimated earnings at $1.10 a share for 1997 and $1.50 for 1998.</p>
<p>-- &quot;We conservatively project a three-year annual growth rate of 35 percent for the company,&quot; Parmalee said.</p>
<p>((-- E. Auchard, Wall Street Bureau, 212-859-1736)</p>
